{
  "description": "Adrenaline and its moves (#10145): every skill module, the short sword, one orc with 100000 health approached before each strike, keys held through console lines. Six times: seven power strikes to fill the gauge (3 each), then a power strike at full (the Fatality), from 55 or 130 units in turn. Three times: fill, then a crouched power strike (+duck: the Whirlwind). Then fill, three taps, 12 s standing, and a power strike.",
